<title>USA: Blyth Industries buys home/auto fragrance co.</title>
<headline>Blyth Industries buys home/auto fragrance co.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blyth Industries Inc said Thursday that it had acquired New Ideas International Inc, a maker of home and auto fragrances.</p>
<p>Blyth said it issued 662,000 shares of its common stock to New Ideas stockholders as consideration in the deal, which will be accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Blyth shares were off 7/8 Thursday morning at 44-3/4.</p>
